    <li><strong>Properties:</strong> Physical and chemical characteristics</li>
    <li><strong>Changes:</strong> Reactions forming new substances</li>
  </ul>
  <h3> APPLICATIONS</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Medicine and healthcare</li>
    <li>Food production</li>
    <li>Energy generation</li>
    <li>Manufacturing industries</li>
  </ul>
  ',
  '[{"q":"What is chemistry?","steps":["Step 1: Identify matter","Step 2: Study composition","Step 3: Study changes"],"ans":"Chemistry is the study of matter and its changes","why":"Core definition"},{"q":"What is matter?","steps":["Step 1: Has mass","Step 2: Occupies space"],"ans":"Anything that has mass and occupies space","why":"Foundation concept"},{"q":"Why is chemistry important?","steps":["Step 1: Explains substances","Step 2: Helps medicine","Step 3: Supports industry"],"ans":"It helps us understand and use materials in real life","why":"Application"},{"q":"What is a chemical change?","steps":["Step 1: Identify reaction","Step 2: New substance formed"],"ans":"A change that forms a new substance","why":"Concept clarity"},{"q":"Why does structure affect properties?","steps":["Step 1: Arrangement matters","Step 2: Affects bonding","Step 3: Changes behavior"],"ans":"Because particle arrangement determines how substances behave","why":"Advanced understanding"}]'
);

